<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/00cc3e77-2ac0-4754-80c2-a662d0f4b67b> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "dark brown suspension forms" ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-09-18"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "In a dry 100 mL vials, combine 0.250 g (0.38 mmol) of 2‑(bis(1,2,4‑triazolyl)phosphine)−(3‑tert‑butyl‑1,1‑diphenyl)thianone, 0.140 g (0.30 mmol, 0.8 equiv.) of bis(4‑(tert‑butyl)phenyl)‑4‑chloropyrimidyl‑1‑butyl‑1‑bromide, 0.040 g (0.05 mmol) of Ni(COD)₂, 0.120 g (0.30 mmol) of 1,4‑bis(tert‑butyl)phenyl)−bis(2,4,6‑trimethoxy‑pyrrole)‑pyridine-4‑yl-4‑COCH₃, 0.050 g (0.30 mmol) of NaOtBu, and 15 mL of 1,2-DCE." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 1 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/0142b889-31d0-4634-a1b7-9c10d532f96d> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Solid is recovered as a fine powder." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-12-26"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "The reaction mixture is poured onto ice, the precipitate is collected by filtration, washed with cold water, and dried under vacuum." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/019b1c21-c575-41c4-b9ab-b38baf0f004b> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Collected fractions containing product visualized by TLC (Rf 0.42, Kováts 0.48)." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2024-04-13"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Purify the crude product by silica gel flash chromatography (hexane/EtOAc 90/10 → 70/30) to afford the desired 2‑(methylthio)‑4‑pentylpropanol." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 7 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/026dca71-63a7-487b-a7c1-32724325da3e> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Clear pale yellow solution." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "In a dry 20 mL Schlenk tube, bis(1,3‑diphenyl‑2‑pyridyl)disulfane (0.12 g, 0.3 mmol) and bromodicyclopentylboronate (0.15 g, 0.35 mmol) are dissolved in anhydrous DMF (5 mL)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 1 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/02c3c9be-e96a-4aca-ba91-3ad7fedb40a4> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "bp 114‑115 °C; purity 99 % (GC)." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-11-25"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Purify by distillation (bp 114 °C) to obtain 4‑tert‑butyl‑pyridine as a colorless liquid." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/0325db3a-dfca-4dd6-95e8-803997327f7a> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "white solid dispersed in clear DCM" ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-09-01"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Charge a dry 4‑mL two‑neck round‑bottom flask with 0.500 g (3.1 mmol) of 2‑(dichloromethyl)phenyl‑1,3,5‑triazine‑4(1h)-one and add 5 mL of dry dichloromethane (DCM).  Seal the flask and sparge with nitrogen for 10 min." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 1 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/036c4d4c-74ca-4892-a2ef-f87bc6188815> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "White precipitate forms." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-06-01"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Cool to room temperature, add 10 mL water, extract with 10 mL of ethyl acetate, and dry the organic phase over Na₂SO₄." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/03a06bf4-4970-4dee-a43f-d2c2d9469e0c> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Yield: 73 % (≈2.6 g)." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-06-01"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Filter, wash with 2 mL of EtOAc, and dry to give the disulfide." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/03b51009-cd6a-47ef-86b2-89781542c179> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Spectroscopic confirmation" ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-04-14"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Characterise the product by ¹H NMR (CDCl₃) and HRMS (ESI+). The ¹H NMR shows characteristic pyridinium signals at 8.05 ppm (d, 2 H). HRMS m/z calculated for C₁₆H₂₀N₂Cl⁺: 311.1334, found 311.1337. " ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 5 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/03db5ad0-84aa-40df-ab46-3f8858959dc4> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Obtained a brown solid." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-01-12"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Dry over Na₂SO₄, filter, concentrate, and purify by silica gel chromatography (hexane/EtOAc 4:1)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/0477574c-6245-442b-82f9-240deca7d347> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Clear solution." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-11-28"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "In a 50 mL round‑bottom flask, dissolve 1.2 g (2.5 mmol) of (1,1‑Dimethyl‑2,3‑dihydro‑2,3‑diphenyl‑1,4‑oxazepin‑5‑yl)trimethylamine n‑oxide in 30 mL MeOH." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 1 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/0493a498-d737-4e95-87ad-46b61e5b0bc8> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Clear amber solution, no precipitation." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-12-15"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "In a dry 25 mL quartz flask, bis(3,5‑dichloro‑2‑(tert‑butyl)phenyl)bis(1,2,4‑triazole)-3‑thiocarbonyl sulfide (0.40 g, 1.1 mmol) is dissolved in anhydrous acetonitrile (5 mL)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 1 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/04f75536-f2c5-4e6d-9eba-adf024767bae> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Clear solution, slight orange tint." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-09-05"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "In a dry 125 mL Schlenk flask, 0.60 g (1.0 mmol) of bis(4-(tert‑butyl)phenyl)‑4‑bromopyrimidyl‑1‑butyl‑1‑bromide is dissolved in anhydrous toluene (20 mL)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 1 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/059c396a-ad78-4ce6-911c-dc88e6f46cc5> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Purified product appears as a white powder." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-11-06"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Concentrate under reduced pressure and purify the residue by flash chromatography (10% ethyl acetate in hexane)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/064da91c-81b8-4567-b285-823a8db06dda> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "A faint turbidity appeared, then cleared as the reaction proceeded." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Cool the solution to 0 °C in an ice‑box and add 3.2 g (24.4 mmol, 7 equiv) of pentylchloride drop‑wise over 15 min while stirring." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 2 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/06bc8cf9-9455-4570-915c-aa047350b95a> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Darkening of solution observed; moderate exotherm at 0 °C resolved within minutes." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2024-11-20"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Add 0.05 g (0.09 mmol) of 2‑chlorobenzyl chloride slowly over 10 min at 0 °C. Stir for 2 h then allow to warm to rt." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 2 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/08755ed8-455b-4cf1-8c3e-3fa37bdd1490> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Product appeared as a pale yellow oil." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-12-05"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Cool to room temperature, quench with sat. Na₂S₂O₃, extract with EtOAc, dry, and concentrate." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/09669c4a-d4de-4a73-9052-e8a289f34657> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Solution turned deep blue, indicative of complex formation." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-07-21"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Introduce 3.6 g (0.015 mol) of n,n′‑diethyl‑4,4′‑diaza‑2,2′‑biphenyl‑5‑carbonitrile dissolved in 50 mL dry DMF. Heat to 80 °C for 6 h while stirring." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 2 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/0a9b5712-33e9-4d77-8966-f5ae7aa94a2c> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Product precipitated upon concentration; visible crystals in solution." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2024-07-23"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Quench by adding 5 mL of iced‑water, extract with EtOAc, wash with brine, dry over Na₂SO₄, filter, evaporate." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/0b1640ad-d10a-421e-a4f2-fbcb175af08d> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "NMR shows clean spectra; no residual starting material." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2026-01-15"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Record the ^1H and ^13C NMR spectra: δ 7.89–7.35 ppm (phenyl), 3.12 ppm (CH₂). Confirm purity by HPLC (99 %)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/0bc36b86-8b29-463a-81ce-c5f6498c406f> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "White solid appeared; no discernible impurity." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2024-05-03"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Precipitate product by adding 20 mL of saturated NH₄Cl solution. Wash with water, dry under vacuum." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/0bf285e9-6eb6-4bae-b474-eb6432577d86> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "The R_f of the starting AcCl decreases; a new spot with R_f = 0.60 appears." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-09-10"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Heat the mixture to 80 °C and stir for 2 h. Monitor by TLC (hexane/EtOAc 4:1)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/0c75e430-24a6-4246-95cc-b75e2cdec2e1> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Crystals formed after solvent removal." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2024-06-13"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Purify by preparative TLC (hexane/EtOAc 80/20) yielding pure silane‑ether." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 5 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/0d550010-eeb4-4cdc-b65a-62673e81d6b6> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Starting material spot disappears; new spot appears at R_f = 0.40." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-06-01"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Heat the reaction to 140 °C and stir for 12 h under reflux. Monitor by TLC (hexane/ethyl acetate 3:1)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/0d72b669-af4a-4a3c-b2ac-bd5e663cd849> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Yielded a deep crimson residue." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2024-10-11"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Cool to room temperature, neutralize with 10 mL saturated NH₄Cl, extract with EtOAc (3×15 mL), dry (Na₂SO₄), and evaporate." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/0dce2f4f-a900-46de-be0a-55393562f4dd> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "colorless TLC spot appears at Rf = 0.48 (new product)" ;
