    hypmol:stepDescription "Characterise via ¹H NMR (CDCl₃) and HRMS (ESI) m/z calc. C₁₆H₁₆Cl₂N₄O₂S⁺ [M + H]⁺: 417.0481; found 417.0482." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/4ccd82a4-235c-4348-b202-0fbf2de62e40> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Solution becomes deep orange, indicating diazo formation." ;
