<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/715bb113-53ff-455d-8113-68ed0ce4a04d> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Yield 60 %" ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-09-16"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Quench with saturated Na₂S₂O₃ solution (10 mL) to reduce excess iodine. Extract with EtOAc (3 × 20 mL). Dry over Na₂SO₄, filter, concentrate, and purify by flash chromatography (hexane/EtOAc 5:1) to obtain the sulfone diiodide. Yield: 0.190 g (60 %)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/71c4a235-bce5-444d-80d8-a2758966addc> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Homogeneous mixture" ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-07-04"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "In a dry 50‑mL round‑bottom flask under nitrogen, combine pentylchloride (0.600 g, 4.1 mmol), bromodicyclopentylboronate (0.580 g, 1.9 mmol), K₂CO₃ (1.02 g, 7.8 mmol), and anhydrous 3‑decanol (25 mL). Add Pd(PPh₃)₄ (30 mg, 0.05 mmol)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 1 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/71cb1796-88da-423d-a5a3-a1e3ef4fe19c> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "white solid obtained" ;
