    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-07-05"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Cool the mixture, dilute with EtOAc (50 mL) and wash successively with brine, water, and brine. Dry over Na₂SO₄, filter and remove the solvent under reduced pressure. The crude product is purified via silica gel flash chromatography (hexane/EtOAc 8:2) to give 0.480 g (63 %) of the coupled product." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

