    hypmol:stepDescription "Heat the mixture to 45 °C under stirring for 10 h. Monitor conversion by ¹H NMR (loss of alkene proton at 5.8 ppm)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 2 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/e9bbe195-6d22-4831-8984-fe0007050030> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Product forms crystalline powder." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2026-01-15"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Purify the residue by preparative TLC (silica gel, hexane–EtOAc = 5/1). Isolate the sulfonamide as a white powder (yield 68 %)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/e9c3eeef-f498-4d8d-9ce6-f353e833b379> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Pure crystals obtained with a melting point of 182 °C." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Concentrate the filtrate under reduced pressure and purify the crude product by recrystallization from acetone/hexane (1:2)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/e9de7bc7-9dc0-4a53-abfb-721fd7781b4f> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "A white precipitate forms that subsequently dissolves, turning the solution pale yellow." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-09-05"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Add 0.5 g (0.008 mol) of trimethylsilyl chloride via syringe, and then swiftly add 1.0 g (0.004 mol) of (1,1‑dimethyl‑2,3‑dihydro‑2,3‑diphenyl‑1,4‑oxazepin‑5‑yl)trimethylamine n‑oxide with a stir bar. Stir at 0 °C for 30 min." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 2 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/ea896443-66cf-44c7-9383-d2b395b0ef23> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Structural confirmation achieved." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-12-28"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Confirm structure by NMR and HRMS; chiral HPLC shows single major peak at 4.12 min." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 5 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/eb9a31aa-644c-4ee8-948b-f08c081893ad> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Mixture is slightly yellow; no precipitation." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-03-20"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "In a dry flask, suspend 1.2 g (0.0045 mol) of 1,4‑diphenyl‑2‑hydroxy‑3‑(tert‑butyl)cyclopropanone and add 0.85 g (0.003 mol) of perfluoro(3‑ethyl‑4‑methyl‑1‑phenyl‑1,2‑bis(ethoxy)ethane) catalyst along with 15 mL dry toluene. Add a catalytic amount of NaH (0.05 g, 0.002 mol) under nitrogen." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 1 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/ec368c18-0fca-442a-a813-48c435b90b00> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Crude is viscous with characteristic odor of iodine release." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-01-15"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Cool to room temperature, open autoclave, dilute with 30 mL EtOAc, wash with brine, dry over MgSO₄, and concentrate to yield a crude oil." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/ec37947c-cd8a-4735-bae3-f0f4b993cb7d> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Dry powder collected (0.26 g)." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-06-02"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Cool, add 50 mL EtOH, filter the precipitate, wash with cold EtOH, and dry under vacuum." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/eca70538-6431-4191-a340-814f306e12db> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Slow colour change from amber to brown." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-12-16"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "The reaction mixture is irradiated under continuous stirring at RT for 8 h while sealed under N₂." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/ecbd405d-43d7-4108-9359-2dbfda953f42> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Solution turns clear upon dissolution." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2024-12-05"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "In a dry 10 mL round‑bottom flask, dissolve 0.25 g (0.70 mmol) of bis(2‑(n‑tert‑butoxycarbonyl)phenyl‑methyl‑sulfide) (K) in 5 mL of dry DMF. Add 0.05 g (0.25 mmol) of potassium carbonate as base." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 1 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/ecf761e4-c7eb-4451-91b3-c69425901016> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Orange‑yellow organic phase obtained; slight emulsion during wash." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2024-06-13"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "After cooling to 25 °C, quench with 10 mL of 1 M HCl and extract with EtOAc. Wash combined layers with brine, dry over MgSO₄, filter, concentrate." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/eda4155e-c2fc-45ff-8eb0-e5b0745f7217> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Clear solution" ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2026-01-04"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Dissolve 4‑(trimetyl‑silyl)pyrrolidin‑2‑yl)pentyl‑sulfonyl chloride (0.180 g, 0.45 mmol) in 50 mL dry DCM under nitrogen. Cool to 0 °C." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 1 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/edd1070d-a54b-4c62-82bb-c3bba066ea84> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Melting point 102–104 °C." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-11-07"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Purify by recrystallization from EtOH to yield N‑hydroaminated product (4a) as a light brown solid (1.02 g, 70 %)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/ede8e1e5-a9a0-4325-ab42-480ee1cb68c4> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "The solution turned slightly cloudy, indicating nucleophile addition." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-11-20"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Cool to 0 °C and add 0.6 g (6.0 mmol, 1.5 equiv) of 2,6‑Diisopropylpyridine (DIPEA) drop‑wise over 10 min." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 2 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/ee2c5e93-0c9f-4339-b87b-b7e7d000835e> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "The organic layer is yellowish." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-11-03"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Cool to room temperature and add 15 mL of water. Extract the mixture with ethyl acetate (3×20 mL). Dry over Na2SO4." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/ee96cf1f-a20c-4db8-b2da-a4b116bdd6ed> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Solution remained clear and colorless during cooling." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-09-12"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Dissolve 5.0 g (0.02 mol) of 2-(methylthio)propanol in 30 mL dry dichloromethane in a 100 mL round‑bottom flask and cool to 0 °C using an ice bath." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 1 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/ef5061e8-9c84-4e36-9676-b9306c8f72e2> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "No exotherm observed, solution remains clear." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-12-05"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Add 0.8 g (2.5 mmol) of (3,4‑epoxymethyltetrahydrofuran‑2‑yl)acetyl chloride and 0.025 g of tetrafluoromethane‑1,2‑diphosphane (1 % wt/wt in THF) to the reaction mixture. Cool to 0 °C for 15 min." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 2 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/eff20b54-6917-40f2-9058-3b8ce94ba698> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "A precipitate of alkylated salt begins to form, turning the solution cloudy." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-11-15"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Add 0.70 g (0.90 mmol) of pentylchloride in one portion and allow the mixture to warm to room temperature, stirring for 8 h." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 2 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f0727236-08d8-449d-9239-266b9dd62a4d> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "No noticeable color change; mixture appears clear." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2026-01-05"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Remove ice bath, allow reaction to warm to r.t. and stir for 2 h." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f0e498ca-dd5a-42ae-b056-ca11b7b2a82e> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "The starting alcohol disappeared; a new spot with Rf = 0.62 matched the product." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Warmed to room temperature and refluxed for 4 h. Monitor the reaction by TLC (hexane/EtOAc 4:1)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f11830f7-25e6-4086-8c83-3381f895d0f5> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "TLC shows complete consumption of the starting ester." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-06-12"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Allow the reaction to warm to room temperature and stir for 4 h, monitoring by TLC (hexane/ethyl acetate 3:1, UV)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f19a123a-67ec-438d-9558-9e5ad3574e1b> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "crude becomes clear amber" ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-11-20"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Quench by adding 20 mL of EtOH, extract with 3 × 10 mL EtOAc, dry over Na₂SO₄, filter, and concentrate." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f1c487bf-c285-4824-aec1-38d4e7d734c2> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Melting point 138–140 °C; HPLC purity 99.5 %." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-12-15"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Purify with flash chromatography (hexane/EtOAc 4:1) to obtain 0.95 g (88 % yield) of the lactone as a white solid." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 5 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f22d54dd-ba9e-4110-9f03-760597937915> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Solution shifts to yellow, indicating complex formation." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-12-18"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Add 0.28 g (0.22 mmol) of hexamethyl‑4‑(tert‑butyl)benzene‑2,3‑diyl di‑(bromophenyl)borate and 5 mol % Pd(PPh₃)₄. Heat to 110 °C for 12 h." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 2 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f2ad7370-a5d6-404f-b2e0-cbd041b7e873> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Filtrate yields a clear solution." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2026-01-15"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Stir at room temperature for 24 h, then filter off the solid by vacuum. Concentrate the filtrate under reduced pressure." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f2dd4d3d-904a-4387-9012-fbf3873825a0> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Obtained colorless organic layer." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2024-09-05"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "After 30 min at 1 mL min⁻¹, quench with 10 mL of ice‑cold water. Separate phases, extract with EtOAc. Wash with brine, dry, filter." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f2f12c13-e878-4dad-ae9f-7d7abe9821e2> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Orange hue develops" ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-12-22"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Add oxone (potassium peroxymonosulfate, 0.420 g, 0.82 mmol) portionwise. Stir at 0 °C for 2 h then allow to warm to rt over 3 h. TLC (CH₂Cl₂/MeOH 96:4) shows a new spot (R_f 0.29)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 2 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f3dd4c74-675a-4c0d-9e62-1a887c283e0e> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "White crystalline solid obtained (yield 76 %)." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-08-17"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Purify by flash chromatography on silica (hexane/EtOAc 9:1 → 5:1). Collect the product (detected by TLC and UV)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 6 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f46f16d9-1d47-446e-83b2-f1466a41db73> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Organic layer retains a pale pink hue." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-04-16"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Quench the reaction with 10 mL of ice‑cold water. Extract the product with EtOAc (3×10 mL). Wash organic phase with 1 M NaHCO₃ (10 mL) to remove acidic by‑products." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f532777a-1095-4cd5-a929-414f6b62dbbf> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Yield 81 %" ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Cool to room temperature, dilute with EtOAc (3 × 30 mL), wash with water, brine, dry over Na₂SO₄. Concentrate and load onto silica gel column (hexane/EtOAc 2:1). Isolate 0.340 g of the sulfonate salt (81 %)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f5e9a836-8ee1-4f37-8222-79de8df6cb1f> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "White solid is obtained, yield 68 %." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2026-01-06"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Filter, wash with cold EtOAc, dry over Na₂SO₄, vacuum evaporate." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 5 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f63ac6be-b34c-48fa-849a-5f765e4a25d4> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Yielded 0.28 g (70 %) of the desired heterocycle as a pale yellow oil." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2024-07-13"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Purify the crude product by flash chromatography on silica gel (hexane/EtOAc 5:1). Collect the fractions containing the product and evaporate under reduced pressure." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f6cbbdd4-35de-461c-8cdc-a3364fbc4778> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Gray Zn particles begin to dissolve, generating CO₂ bubbles." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-07-02"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Heat the mixture to 80 °C, maintain for 30 min. (Use a temperature‑controlled oil bath)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f7605cc8-b1bd-4d37-97f1-fb5dca7b48d4> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Silky liquid, density 0.87 g mL⁻¹." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-08-02"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "The crude residue is purified by flash chromatography (silica gel, 4 % EtOAc in hexanes) to give the target ether as a colorless liquid (0.95 g, 54 % yield)." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 4 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f8699c42-2290-42b3-91b1-a5f5878223b6> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Yield 78 %" ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2026-01-05"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Quench with saturated NaHCO₃ (10 mL), extract with DCM (3×20 mL). Wash with brine, dry over Na₂SO₄, filter, concentrate. Recrystallize from EtOH to give 0.133 g (78 %) of the N‑oxide salt." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 3 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f9154921-3e8f-47aa-9aa7-ecaf4a6eb884> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Crystals formed spontaneously within 30 min." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2024-05-04"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Recrystallize from ethyl acetate/hexane (1:1) to afford pure bicyclic triazine." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 5 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f924e7f4-9c31-4bff-91d2-4dec403ef548> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Solid dissolves slowly in dry acetone." ;
    hypmol:procedureDate "2025-11-01"^^xsd:date ;
    hypmol:stepDescription "Add 0.55 g (3.0 mmol, 1.0 equiv) of (3,4‑epoxymethyltetrahydrofuran‑2‑yl)acetyl chloride to a dry 250 mL round‑bottom flask equipped with a magnetic stir bar under a nitrogen atmosphere." ;
    hypmol:stepOrder 1 .

<https://hypmol.net/ProcedureStep/f92d659b-0c09-4950-9d91-0d795eaa1e24> a hypmol:ProcedureStep ;
    hypmol:observation "Dark red solution; concentration verified by NMR." ;
